    2s; cook meat for 6s; cheese is ready.\n\n<color=#63B8FF><b>[3] SERVE</b></color> 
    Match the table card. Faster complete orders score more.\n\n<color=#FF6655><b>[4]
    CLEAN UP</b></color>  Wrong items stay in hand\u2014discard them at the trash.\n\n<b>WASD
